OL,3,AUN votes to adopt new world map to
OL,4,Areflect Africa's true size
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UN General Assembly has voted to
OL,7,Freplace the traditional world map with
OL,8,Fone that more accurately reflects the
OL,9,Fsize of Africa.
OL,11,FThe "Correct the Map" resolution,
OL,12,Fsponsored by Togo and backed by African
OL,13,FUnion (AU) members, passed with the
OL,14,Fsupport of 164 nations, including
OL,15,FFrance and the UK. The United States
OL,16,Fwas the only nation to vote against it
OL,17,F- and there were six abstentions.
OL,19,FThe UN vote is non-binding but will see
OL,20,Fchanges to the maps used by
OL,21,Finstitutions around the world.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
