OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUN votes to adopt new world map to
OL,4,Areflect Africa's true size
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Mercator map, which has been in
OL,7,Fcommon use since the 16th Century, has
OL,8,Fcome in for criticism as it shows
OL,9,FAfrica as similar in size to Greenland,
OL,10,Feven though it is 14 times larger.
